# Project Pixelage #


## **Source Changelog** ##

**13 February 2025**

```bash
- Addressed an issue where memory leaks might occured when users open up network dashboard in Settings
- Added LMODroid Freeform
- Added Flashlight strength level on supported devices
- Added Richtap vibrations on supported devices
- Brought back option to disable backpressure propagation
```

**05 February 2025**

```bash
- Added option to adjust minimal auto brightness
- Added option to cut off internet for specific apps
- Added Livedisplay
- Added Per-app volume
- Added Quick Tap
- Added Camelot (PDF Viewer by Lineage)
- Play integrity does not required an APK anymore (It will updates automatically during reboot)
- Whole UI revamped on Radio Info
```

**08 January 2025**

```bash
- Merged January 2025 security patch
- Added smart 5G toggle
- Added options of Adguard and Cloudfare DNS to Private DNS Provider
- Added Lineage's HTPR and Fastcharge for compatible devices
- Disabled default frame rate limit for games by default
- Dropped Lineage's AudioFX
- Switched to Google Package Installer
- Updated T-Mobile APNs from Lineage
```

**02 January 2025**

```bash
- Fixed fullscreen cutout
- Added misc improvements to SystemUI
```

**25 December 2024**

```bash
- Added APK based PIF (Users can do PIF update in the future by updating APK instead of flashing the whole rom)
- Added option to disable screenshot sound
- Re-organize sound options
```

**21 December 2024**

```bash
- Added back Cellular and Wi-Fi QS Tiles
- Added back hotspot toggle in Internet QS Tile
- Added back UDFPS
- Added back Lineage's Scramble PIN & lock pattern size
- Added back force fullscreen cutout
- Fixed an issue where AOD and Caffeine QS Tile will caused the tile size to be unusual huge
- Fixed an issue where tapping into previous "screen recording saved" notification will lead to SystemUI crashes
- Reverted back to Pre-A15 QPR1 QS Colours
```

**14 December 2024**

```bash
- Added back Applock
- Added back Faceunlock
- Fixed an issue where notifications will overlapped with clock in lockscreen
- Fixed an issue where AOD lockscreen will do fade transition instead of animation
- Fixed an issue where SystemUI will crashes into Android Rescue instantly after set up "Weather Lockscreen Clock"
- Set default lockscreen keyguard affordance "Left - Torch | Right - Camera"
```

**9 December 2024**

```bash
- Initial Android 15 QPR1
- December Security Patch
- Spoof as ASUS Rog 8 for few selected games
```

**24 November 2024**

```bash
- Added App Lock
- Added improvement for QS expanding animations
- Added misc improvements to HWUI
- Updated GApps to nov (should fixed Google's backup and restore)
- Updated PIHooks komodo FP to nov
- Spoof as realme GT 7 Pro for few games
```

**12 November 2024**

```bash
- Added GameSpace
```

**7 November 2024**

```bash
- Merged November Security Patch
- Added Option to show VoLTE & WiFi Calling statusbar icon
- Added Option to disable data disabled indicator
- Added Option to change LTE to 4G indicator
- Added Pure black theme
- Added Clone Apps
- Added Option to configure rotation degree (0,90,180,270)
- Added Option to show Data Usage in QS
- Added Lineage Screen Lock options (including scramble pin)
- Fixed an issue where QS power menu still accessible when the phone are locked
- Updated new screenshot sound from Nothing Phone
```

**31 October 2024**

```bash
- Added OTA support
- Added option to wipe /system partition on stock recovery for user build
- Fixed stock recovery shown "unknown version"
- Misc improvements to SystemUI
- Set release-keys on all signing builds (Improve custom rom detection on certain apps)
```

**23 October 2024**

```bash
- Added brand new Pixelage wallpaper (white and dark themed) (credits: @proxima009)
- Added boost gesture flings
- Added face unlock
- Added brightness curve (users that faced low outdoor brightness can add "persist.sys.brightness.low.gamma" in the build.prop)
- Checkout ton of APNs from Lineage
- Enabled R8 optimizations for system_server and SystemUI
- Enabled A15 QPR1 new revamped setting looks
- Fixed an issue where "Status bar icons" displaying white theme even when dark theme is applied
```

**17 October 2024**

```bash
- Merged October Security Patch
- Added An option to upload crashing logs whenever an app crashes
- Added Battery widget
- Added Charging Control from LineageOS
- Added Circle to Search and turned on by default
- Added Circle to Search toggle in Navigation section
- Added Pixel offline charging animation
- Fixed DeviceAsWebcam showing inverted colours (Red->Blue) on qcom devices
- Fixed Pixel Launcher's Overview Suggestions crashes
- Fixed an issue where multi-user avatar picker crashes
- Updated Pixel 9 Pro XL (komodo) FP to October
```

**11 October 2024**

```bash
- Updated FP to fix Play Integrity
```

**1 October 2024**

```bash
- Added fixes for the wrongly placed fingerprint indicator for side fingerprint devices
- Fixed an issue where Indonesian users might failed to top up on certain apps like BCA using NFC
- Moved "Battery Info" to battery section
- Reduced more background unnecessary logspams
```

**29 September 2024**

```bash
- Added Smartspace on lockscreen
- Added Double tap to sleep on lockscreen and status bar
- Added more options for screen recording
- Fixed an issue where double tap to wake from AOD doesn't wake the screen
- Fixed "Touch to unlock anytime"

```

**22 September 2024**

```bash
- Added LTE_CA toggle
- Added PIF Spoof toggle (Disable it to use with trickystore for Strong Integrity)
- Added Long press volume rocker to skip tracks
- Added Hide ADB and Developer settings option (Can trick certain apps that detects developer options)
- Added Optional haptic feedback for back gesture (Users that had issue with haptics with back gesture can enable this option)
- Added Restart SystemUI in Advanced Reboot
- Added minor changes to expanded QS where you can press date, time, battery, carrier text will opens up the respectively section
- Auto wipe package_cache on dirty flash (Should fix issue where users might faced weird setting overlapping texts after they done dirty flash)
- Granted a few GApps permissions that are missing (It should decrease amount of apps screaming in background about missing permissions)
- Silence a lot of useless background logs to improve battery life
- Spoof Wechat as Samsung Galaxy Tab A7 Lite
```

**16 September 2024**

```bash
- Initial Android 15 release
- Pixelage is now fully based on AOSP with small pinch of Lineage
```

**6 September 2024**

```bash
- Merged September Security Patch
- Updated Pixel 9 FP
- Added option to turn on Bluetooth with one tap
```

**31 August 2024**

```bash
- Added option to hide ADB and Developer options
- Added QS Tile to change Preferred Network
- Added QS Tile to show Compass
- Added QS Tile to show Volume Panel
- Added "CHARGING BOLT" symbol in statusbar for text only battery percentage while charging
- Added Increasing ring volume feature
- Brought back Live Translate
- Redo Cutout force fullscreen options
- Allow skipping of nativeDetachImage
```
